# 🚀 Startup Analytics Dashboard

Professional Streamlit Dashboard for Startup Ecosystem Analysis.

## Features

- Executive Summary
- Funding Analytics
- Industry Analysis
- Regional Insights
- Startup Health Score
- AI Insights

## Installation

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Run

```bash
streamlit run app.py
```

## Tech Stack

- Python
- Streamlit
- Plotly
- Pandas
- Scikit-Learn
